{
  "annotations": {"list": []},
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "当前 Firing 告警",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "red", "value": 1}]}
        }
      },
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "title": "当前 Pending 告警",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"pending\"})", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {"mode": "absolute", "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}, {"color": "orange", "value": 1}]}
        }
      },
      "options": {"colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "center", "reduceOptions": {"calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false}, "textMode": "value_and_name"}
    },
    {
      "title": "Firing 告警按严重级别",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "count by (severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})", "legendFormat": "{{severity}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}}
    },
    {
      "title": "Firing 告警按子系统",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0},
      "targets": [
        {"expr": "count by (subsystem) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})", "legendFormat": "{{subsystem}}", "refId": "A"}
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}}
    },
    {
      "title": "告警明细（Firing / Pending）",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {"h": 15, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=~\"$alertstate\",severity=~\"$severity\",domain=~\"$domain\",subsystem=~\"$subsystem\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {"id": "labelsToFields", "options": {"mode": "columns"}},
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {"Time": true, "Value": true, "job": true, "instance": true},
            "indexByName": {"alertname": 0, "alertstate": 1, "severity": 2, "domain": 3, "subsystem": 4, "service": 5, "target_id": 6, "queue_family": 7},
            "renameByName": {"alertname": "告警名称", "alertstate": "状态", "severity": "严重级别", "domain": "域", "subsystem": "子系统", "service": "服务", "target_id": "目标", "queue_family": "队列", "Value": "值"}
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "数据来自 Prometheus ALERTS 指标；Prometheus 告警规则的 annotations（summary/description）请在 Prometheus 或 Alertmanager 详情页查看。"
    },
    {
      "title": "告警活跃时长",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - ALERTS_FOR_STATE{alertstate=~\"$alertstate\",severity=~\"$severity\",domain=~\"$domain\",subsystem=~\"$subsystem\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}} / {{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0}}
    },
    {
      "title": "告警查看入口",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 告警链路\n\n- 本页读取 Prometheus 的 `ALERTS` 和 `ALERTS_FOR_STATE` 指标，展示当前 **Firing / Pending** 告警。\n- 告警通知由 Alertmanager 按路由发送；邮件、Webhook 投递状态请打开部署对应的 Alertmanager 页面。\n- Prometheus 告警详情：`/alerts`\n- Alertmanager 告警详情：`/#/alerts`\n\n> 没有数据表示当前没有符合筛选条件的 Pending/Firing 告警，不代表所有规则都不存在。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["omcgo", "alerts", "operations"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "alertstate",
        "label": "状态",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "firing, pending",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": ["$__all"]}
      },
      {
        "name": "severity",
        "label": "严重级别",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ALERTS, severity)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": ["$__all"]}
      },
      {
        "name": "domain",
        "label": "域",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ALERTS, domain)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": ["$__all"]}
      },
      {
        "name": "subsystem",
        "label": "子系统",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ALERTS, subsystem)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {"text": "All", "value": ["$__all"]}
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {"from": "now-6h", "to": "now"},
  "title": "OMC - 告警总览",
  "uid": "omc-alert-overview"
}
